Grounding effect: faithfulness rises by 0.401 (0.552 -> 0.953) when retrieval is enabled.
Unsupported claims per chapter fall from 3.0 to 0.417. In a narrative science tool each unsupported claim is a candidate
misconception delivered in a memorable form, so this is the safety argument for the RAG layer,
not merely an accuracy improvement.

